Package: onix-xi1-control
Version: __VERSION__
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: romanio427
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.35), libgcc-s1, libfontconfig1, libx11-6, libx11-xcb1, libxcb1, libxkbcommon0, libxkbcommon-x11-0, libgl1
Recommends: xdg-desktop-portal (>= 1.16), xwayland
Description: ONIX XI1 PC control
 Sends volume and mode commands to the XI1 over USB.
 Requires X11 or XWayland for the compact overlay.
